On a Dell XPS 13 9360 with QCA6174

     ath10k_pci 0000:3a:00.0: qca6174 hw3.2 target 0x05030000 chip_id 
0x00340aff sub 1a56:1535
     ath10k_pci 0000:3a:00.0: kconfig debug 0 debugfs 0 tracing 0 dfs 0 
testmode 0
     ath10k_pci 0000:3a:00.0: firmware ver WLAN.RM.4.4.1-00309- api 6 
features wowlan,ignore-otp,mfp crc32 0793bcf2

I sometimes see the message below:

     $ journalctl -a
     […]
     Sep 21 17:24:40 abreu kernel: Linux version 
6.11.0-07463-g7048c3743423 (build@bohemianrhapsody.molgen.mpg.de) (gcc 
