quick kickout for STA 88:71:b1:81:93:1a
     [ some more ]
     Dez 02 08:11:08 abreu kernel: Linux version 
6.12.0-12113-gbcc8eda6d349 (build@bohemianrhapsody.molgen.mpg.de) (gcc 
(Debian 14.2.0-8) 14.2.0, GNU ld (GNU Binutils for Debian) 
2.43.50.20241126) #34 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sun Dec  1 15:51:39 CET 2024
     […]
     Dez 03 10:12:49 abreu kernel: ath10k_pci 0000:3a:00.0: Spurious 
quick kickout for STA 04:bd:88:b7:31:60

As the warning contains the word “spurious”, could be found out more 
about the details? At least today I would have thought it is due to bad 
connectivity to the access point:

     $ LANG= nmcli -f SSID,BSSID,SIGNAL,ACTIVE dev wifi list
     SSID       BSSID              SIGNAL  ACTIVE
     eduroam    04:BD:88:B7:31:70  33      yes
     […]

